<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>You're on the {{brandName}} waitlist!</title>
</head>
<body style="font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif; line-height: 1.6; color: #333; background-color: #f4f4f4; margin: 0; padding: 0;">
  <div style="max-width: 600px; margin: 20px auto; background: #fff; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.1);">

    <div style="background: #111827; padding: 40px 20px; text-align: center;">
      <h1 style="margin: 0; font-size: 28px; font-weight: 700; color: #00ff90;">{{brandName}}</h1>
    </div>

    <div style="padding: 30px 20px;">
      <p style="font-size: 18px; margin-top: 0;">Hi {{#if name}}{{name}}{{else}}there{{/if}},</p>

      <p>Thanks for signing up to the {{brandName}} waitlist. We are genuinely thrilled to have you on board.</p>

      <p>{{brandName}} is a modern club management platform, built specifically for clubs like yours. Sessions, payments, communications, member management, all in one place. No more spreadsheets, no more chasing.</p>

      {{#if clubName}}
      <div style="background: #F0FDF4; border-left: 4px solid #00ff90; padding: 20px; margin: 25px 0; border-radius: 4px;">
        <p style="margin: 0; color: #166534; font-weight: 600;">You are joining as a founding club.</p>
        <p style="margin: 8px 0 0 0; color: #166534;">That means early access, direct input on the features we build, and preferential pricing locked in from day one.</p>
      </div>
      {{/if}}

      <p>We will keep you updated as we get closer to launch. In the meantime, if you have any questions at all, just reply to this email. I read every one.</p>

      <p style="margin-top: 30px;">
        Cheers,<br>
        <strong>Mike</strong><br>
        <span style="color: #64748B;">Founder of {{brandName}}</span>
      </p>
    </div>

    <div style="background: #F8FAFC; padding: 20px; text-align: center; color: #64748B; font-size: 13px;">
      <p style="margin: 5px 0;">&copy; {{year}} {{brandName}}. All rights reserved.</p>
      <p style="margin: 5px 0;"><a href="{{unsubscribeUrl}}" style="color: #64748B; text-decoration: underline;">Unsubscribe</a></p>
    </div>

  </div>
</body>
</html>
